---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
    title="Privacy"
    description="What data kubre.in collects, what it does not, and how comments and analytics are handled."
>
    <main id="main" class="py-8 space-y-6 text-xs md:text-sm text-carbon leading-6">
        <h1 class="uppercase text-2xl font-bold text-carbon-lighter">Privacy</h1>

        <p>
            Short version: this site does not track you. There are no accounts, no cookies set by
            the site itself, no advertising, and no cross-site trackers.
        </p>

        <section class="space-y-2">
            <h2 class="font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-carbon-lighter">Analytics</h2>
            <p>
                Pages are served through Cloudflare, which keeps standard server logs (IP address,
                requested URL, timestamp) for security and abuse prevention. Aggregate, anonymized
                traffic counts come from Cloudflare Web Analytics, which does not use cookies or
                fingerprint individual visitors. Vaibhav can see that a page was visited; he cannot
                see who you are.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-2">
            <h2 class="font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-carbon-lighter">Comments</h2>
            <p>
                Blog posts use Giscus, which stores comments in the public
                <a class="underline hover:bg-yellow-400/40" href="https://github.com/kubre"
                    >GitHub</a
                >
                discussions of this site's repository. If you comment, GitHub handles your account, avatar,
                and comment content under
                <a
                    class="underline hover:bg-yellow-400/40"
                    href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/github-privacy-statement"
                    >GitHub's privacy statement</a
                >. Comments are public by nature.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-2">
            <h2 class="font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-carbon-lighter">Your content</h2>
            <p>
                Unless noted otherwise, writing and images on this site are licensed CC BY 4.0 —
                quote, reuse, and cite freely with attribution to Vaibhav Kubre and a link back to
                the canonical URL.
            </p>
        </section>

        <p>
            Questions about any of this? See the
            <a class="underline hover:bg-yellow-400/40" href="/contact/">Contact</a> page. Last reviewed:
            August 2026.
        </p>
    </main>
</Layout>
